                <div class="project-pin-badge">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 12V4h1V2H7v2h1v8l-2 2v2h5.2v6h1.6v-6H18v-2l-2-2z"/></svg>
                    <span>Pinned</span>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card__tags">
                    <span class="project-tag">Self-Hosted</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Docker</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Cloudflare Tunnels</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Ghost</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">MySQL</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Disaster Recovery</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="project-card__title">Personal Cloud &amp; Homelab Infrastructure</h2>
                <p class="project-card__desc">
                    The bare-metal homelab infrastructure powering this website and my daily self-hosted developer tools. Runs containerized services securely routed through Cloudflare zero-trust tunnels, featuring automated multi-database backups to encrypted offsite cloud storage, one-click disaster recovery runbooks, and automated integration tests.
                </p>
                <div class="project-card__links">
                    <a href="https://kalp.dev" class="project-link project-link--live" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <svg class="btn-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line></svg>
                        <span>Live Site ↗</span>
