                    <span class="project-tag">Python</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Selenium</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Raspberry Pi</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Linux / systemd</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Automation</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="project-card__title">Community Center Court Booking Bot</h2>
                <p class="project-card__desc">
                    A lightweight automation bot running 24/7 on a Raspberry Pi to book community center badminton courts right when registrations open at 6:00 AM. Handles session logins, automated retry loops on high-traffic drops, and native systemd background scheduling.
                </p>
                <div class="project-card__links">
                    <a href="https://github.com/Kalp-S/mississaugaBooking" class="project-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
