            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-card__tags">
                    <span class="project-tag">Docker Compose</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Cloudflare Tunnels</span>
                    <span class="project-tag">Homelab</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="project-card__title">Self-Hosted Note Synchronization Server</h2>
                <p class="project-card__desc">
                    A private synchronization backend for syncing markdown notes and attachments across my laptop, desktop, and phone. Runs in Docker backed by PostgreSQL with automated scheduled snapshots and encrypted remote access via Cloudflare Tunnels.
                </p>
                <div class="project-card__links">
                    <a href="https://github.com/Kalp-S/joplin-server" class="project-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
